3108 0 obj
  << /ActualText (\015\nCreated user personas\054 journey maps\054 user flows\054 wireframes\054 prototypes \050paper\054 low\055fidelity\054 high\055fidelity\051\054 and all UI assets for an experience that teaches middle\055schoolers about career opportunities in the entertainment technology industry through creating their own animatronic puppet show\056 \nDesigned and prototyped interfaces for five interconnected workstations\054 enabling students to complete collaborative\054 role\055specific workflows\056\nAlso programmed the lighting station frontend to work with a DMX control backend\056 \nIterated through multiple rounds of playtesting with users and close collaboration with developer\056\nBuilt a reusable component library in Figma to improve design consistency and to pass on to future teams\056\nMarketing and Branding\072 Designed logo and brand identity for team\056)
     /K [ 24 ]
     /P 3109 0 R
     /Pg 3069 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
